# mojro-ai-workspace
#
# This repo is carved out of the shared `mojro` workspace folder. It tracks
# ONLY the AI-agent context system (Cursor rules/skills + docs/ai). Every
# service lives in its own separate git repo checked out as a subdirectory
# here (api/*, api-common/*, analytics/*) and must never be tracked by this
# repo, nor must IDE state, build tooling, or stray binaries.
#
# Strategy: deny everything by default, then explicitly re-include only the
# AI-context paths. This is deliberate — do NOT "simplify" this by switching
# to an exclude-list of today's clutter. A deny-first default means any new
# top-level file or folder added later (another service checkout, a new temp
# dir, a downloaded installer) is safe by default with no .gitignore update.
# If you need to track something new under this repo, add an explicit `!`
# re-include for it below, following the existing pattern.

*

!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!README.md

!.cursor/
!.cursor/**

!docs/
!docs/ai/
!docs/ai/**
